  "2026-10-16T22:42:14.150Z",codex-agent,Three OFL Latin WOFF2 subsets total 116552 bytes (limit 120000). All requested encoded characters available upstream and axis ranges retained. Preserve upstream axis defaults; omit unencoded optional alternates/ligatures for budget. Real metrics measured using Liberation metric equivalents; exact URLs/revision in fonts/SOURCES.md.
  "2026-10-16T22:45:25.075Z",codex-agent,"Fallback refinement before Milestone 1: shipped overrides use real Arial/Courier New x-height measurements from the pinned Capsize 4.4.0 dataset and target metrics read from the actual shipped WOFF2 files, replacing the preliminary Liberation-equivalent measurements. Binary audit preserves all 233/221/224 encoded glyphs in the requested repertoire and the complete required axis ranges."
